<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">For a discussion of the Company&#8217;s independent directors&#8217; compensation, see below. Compensation amounts include compensation relating to fiscal year ended December&#160;31, 2024 that was payable as of December&#160;31, 2024 and paid during the fiscal year ended December&#160;31, 2025. </div></td></tr></table>
