<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">The Company does not maintain a stock or option plan, <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">non-equity</div> incentive plan or pension plan for its directors. </div></td></tr></table>
<table style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
