<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Mr.&#160;Westwood resigned from his role as an independent director on October&#160;14, 2025. </div></td></tr></table> <div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div> <div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">26 </div> </div></div></div></div></div>


